WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.567
Create and name a reusable test suite.

2
00:00:06.567 --> 00:00:10.533
Choose which checks belong in the suite.

3
00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:12.933
Use the smoke tag to select the release checks.

4
00:00:12.933 --> 00:00:17.883
Review the matching checks and save the suite.

5
00:00:17.883 --> 00:00:22.050
Open the saved suite whenever it is needed.

6
00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:23.400
Open the saved suite and start a run.

7
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:27.450
Name this execution of the smoke suite.

8
00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:31.600
Create a new run from the suite and start testing.
